@startuml

footbox off

title Sequence Diagram - US007 Register a new country in the System

box "Tests" #LightYellow
actor Administrator
participant ":UI" as UI
end box

participant ":CountryController" as CountryController
participant ":CountryRepository" as AddressRepository

Administrator -> UI : **1** registerNewCountry (name)

UI -> CountryController : **2** registerNewCountry (name)
activate CountryController

CountryController -> AddressRepository : **3** addNewCountry (name)
activate AddressRepository

create "newCountry1: Country" as Country
AddressRepository -> Country : **4** createCountry(name)

AddressRepository -> AddressRepository : **5** validateToAdd (newCountry1)
AddressRepository --> CountryController : **6** true
deactivate AddressRepository

CountryController --> UI : **7** sucess
deactivate CountryController

UI --> Administrator : **8** sucess

@enduml